## Solution overview

### Fix
Apply a ruleset on `normainofficial/normain-infra/main` mirroring `normain`'s shape:
- Require PR
- ≥1 approval
- No force-push, no deletion
- Linear history
- (Optional) required status check: lightweight `terraform fmt -check && terraform validate` workflow

~5 min if no status check; ~30 min with the `terraform validate` workflow added.

